# Week 3 Day 1 — a real project gitignores its local SQLite database
# (it's per-developer local data, not something to version-control).
# This zip ships database/database.sqlite anyway, as a convenience empty
# starting point — normally that file wouldn't be committed at all; it'd
# be created locally via `touch database/database.sqlite` before running
# `php artisan migrate` for the first time.
database/database.sqlite
